DESCRIPTION:Jeffrey Keller is a standup comedian based out of New York City
  known for his sharp wit\, boyish charm\, and a unique sense of humor that 
 draws from his background in musical theatre and everyday life. Jeffrey bri
 ngs a hammy edge to his standup\, blending storytelling with impeccable tim
 ing. As a straight man with an eclectic mix of mainly gay theatre friends\,
  he offers a perspective that's both fresh and relatable. Despite his punch
 able face and mullet\, it's his big smile and infectious energy that win ov
 er audiences every time.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/e
 vent/jeffrey-keller-s-bloomington-debut-59229/
